{% doc %}
  @prompt
    Erstelle mir eine neue Custom Section für meine Shopify Startseite nach folgendem Design.
    
    Es soll eine mobile-first Hero Section für die Premium Beauty Brand SEREN werden.
    
    Die Section soll so aussehen:
    
    Mobile Aufbau:
    Oben steht ein großes, hochwertiges Hero-Bild über fast die volle Breite. Das Bild soll weich gerundet sein und eine elegante Beauty-/Morgenroutine zeigen. Darunter kommt der Content.
    
    Unter dem Bild:
    1. Kleiner Badge
    2. Große emotionale Headline
    3. Kurzer Beschreibungstext
    4. Preiszeile
    5. Farbauswahl / Varianten-Auswahl
    6. Großer „In den Warenkorb“-Button
    7. Trust Text
    8. Kleine Trust Boxen darunter
    
    Desktop Aufbau:
    Zweispaltiges Layout.
    Links steht der Textbereich mit Badge, Headline, Beschreibung, Preis, Variantenauswahl, Button und Trust-Elementen.
    Rechts steht das große Hero-Bild.
    Das Bild soll auf Desktop immer full width innerhalb der rechten Bildspalte sein, also nicht klein oder schmal dargestellt werden.
    Die Section soll hochwertig, ruhig, clean und conversion-optimiert aussehen.
    
    Brand:
    SEREN
    
    Produkt:
    Ein kabelloser Soft-Heat Touch-Up Styling Comb für Frauen 45+, der morgens hilft, Frizz und unruhige Haarpartien sanft zu bändigen.
    
    Zielgruppe:
    Frauen 45–65, elegant, qualitätsbewusst, skeptisch gegenüber Beauty-Hype.
    Sie wollen nicht jünger aussehen, sondern gepflegter und ordentlicher wirken.
    
    Kernidee:
    Nicht jünger. Einfach gepflegter.
    
    Look & Feel:
    Premium Beauty
    Warmes Creme / Champagne / Taupe Farbsystem
    Dunkelbraune oder schwarze Schrift
    Subtile Beige / Rose-Gold Akzente
    Weiche Rundungen
    Viel Weißraum
    Ruhige hochwertige Typografie
    Kein billiger Dropshipping-Look
    Keine aggressive Salespage
    Keine Anti-Aging-Sprache
    Keine Miracle Claims
    
    Default Texte:
    
    Badge:
    Soft-Heat Touch-Up Comb
    
    Headline:
    Wenn dein Haar morgens nicht mehr so sitzt wie früher.
    
    Beschreibung:
    SEREN glättet unruhige Partien sanft, bändigt Frizz und bringt dein Haar in wenigen Minuten wieder in Form — ohne hartes Glätteisen-Gefühl.
    
    Preis:
    SEREN Morning Touch-Up Set — 89 €
    
    Button:
    In den Warenkorb
    
    Trust Text:
    Sanfte Wärme · Kabellos · Für den täglichen Morgen-Touch-Up
    
    Trust Boxen:
    30 Tage testen
    Kostenloser Versand
    Sichere Zahlung
    
    Funktion:
    Der Button soll ein echter „In den Warenkorb“-Button sein.
    Ich möchte ein Produkt auswählen können.
    Die Kundin muss zuerst eine Farbe / Variante auswählen, bevor sie das Produkt in den Warenkorb legen kann.
    Die Varianten sollen aus dem ausgewählten Shopify Produkt kommen.
    Keine hardcoded Variantennamen verwenden.
    
    Bitte keine Kommentar-Box, kein Zitatfeld und keine zusätzliche Micro-Comment-Box einbauen.
    
    Die Section soll folgende Einstellungen im Shopify Editor haben:
    
    Produkt & Warenkorb:
    - Produkt auswählen
    - Button Text
    - Farbauswahl aktivieren
    - Label für Farbauswahl
    - Fehlertext, wenn keine Farbe gewählt wurde
    
    Hero Bild:
    - Desktop Bild
    - Mobile Bild
    - Bild Alt Text
    - Bild Border Radius
    - Bildhöhe Mobile
    - Bildhöhe Desktop
    - Bildposition
    
    Badge:
    - Badge Text
    - Badge Farbe
    - Badge Hintergrundfarbe
    - Badge Textgröße Mobile
    - Badge Textgröße Desktop
    - Badge Border Radius
    
    Titel:
    - Titel Text
    - Titel Farbe
    - Titel Textgröße Mobile
    - Titel Textgröße Desktop
    - Titel Zeilenhöhe
    - Titel maximale Breite
    
    Beschreibung:
    - Beschreibungstext
    - Beschreibung Farbe
    - Beschreibung Textgröße Mobile
    - Beschreibung Textgröße Desktop
    - Beschreibung Zeilenhöhe
    - Beschreibung maximale Breite
    
    Preis:
    - Preis anzeigen ein/aus
    - Vergleichspreis anzeigen ein/aus
    - Preis Textgröße
    - Preis Farbe
    
    Button:
    - Button Hintergrundfarbe
    - Button Textfarbe
    - Button Textgröße
    - Button Border Radius
    - Button Padding
    - Button volle Breite auf Mobile ein/aus
    
    Trust Text:
    - Trust Text
    - Trust Textfarbe
    - Trust Textgröße
    - Abstand zum Button
    
    Trust Boxen:
    Bitte als editierbare Blöcke erstellen.
    Jede Trust Box soll haben:
    - Icon Text, z. B. ✓
    - Text
    - optionaler Link
    
    Layout & Abstände:
    - Hintergrundfarbe
    - Padding oben Mobile
    - Padding unten Mobile
    - Padding oben Desktop
    - Padding unten Desktop
    - Max Width Desktop
    - Abstand zwischen Text und Bild Desktop
    - Abstand zwischen Bild und Text Mobile
    - Textausrichtung Mobile
    - Textausrichtung Desktop
    
    Wichtig:
    Die Section soll stabil funktionieren und im Shopify Editor sichtbar sein.
    Bitte möglichst nah an einem hochwertigen Premium Beauty Hero Design bleiben.
    Mobile First ist am wichtigsten.
{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}

{% style %}
  .seren-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: block;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.background_color }};
    padding-top: {{ block.settings.padding_top_mobile }}px;
    padding-bottom: {{ block.settings.padding_bottom_mobile }}px;
  }

  .seren-hero-container-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    max-width: {{ block.settings.max_width_desktop }}px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding-left: 20px;
    padding-right: 20px;
  }

  .seren-hero-layout-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: {{ block.settings.gap_mobile }}px;
  }

  .seren-hero-image-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 100%;
    order: 1;
  }

  .seren-hero-image-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 100%;
    height: {{ block.settings.image_height_mobile }}px;
    object-fit: {{ block.settings.image_position }};
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.image_border_radius }}px;
    display: block;
  }

  .seren-hero-image-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 100%;
    height: {{ block.settings.image_height_mobile }}px;
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.image_border_radius }}px;
    overflow: hidden;
    background-color: #f4f4f4;
    position: relative;
  }

  .seren-hero-image-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }} svg {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
  }

  .seren-hero-content-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    order: 2;
    text-align: {{ block.settings.text_align_mobile }};
  }

  .seren-hero-badge-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: inline-block;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.badge_bg_color }};
    color: {{ block.settings.badge_color }};
    padding: 8px 16px;
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.badge_border_radius }}px;
    font-size: {{ block.settings.badge_font_size_mobile }}px;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0.5px;
  }

  .seren-hero-title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    color: {{ block.settings.title_color }};
    font-size: {{ block.settings.title_font_size_mobile }}px;
    line-height: {{ block.settings.title_line_height }};
    margin: 0 0 16px 0;
    font-weight: 600;
    max-width: {{ block.settings.title_max_width }}px;
    margin-left: auto;
    margin-right: auto;
  }

  .seren-hero-description-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    color: {{ block.settings.description_color }};
    font-size: {{ block.settings.description_font_size_mobile }}px;
    line-height: {{ block.settings.description_line_height }};
    margin: 0 0 24px 0;
    max-width: {{ block.settings.description_max_width }}px;
    margin-left: auto;
    margin-right: auto;
  }

  .seren-hero-price-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: {{ block.settings.price_font_size }}px;
    color: {{ block.settings.price_color }};
    margin-bottom: 20px;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .seren-hero-price-{{ ai_gen_id }} .price__regular {
    margin-right: 8px;
  }

  .seren-hero-price-{{ ai_gen_id }} .price__sale {
    color: {{ block.settings.price_color }};
  }

  .seren-hero-price-{{ ai_gen_id }} .price__compare {
    text-decoration: line-through;
    opacity: 0.6;
    font-size: 0.9em;
  }

  .seren-hero-variant-selector-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }

  .seren-hero-variant-label-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: {{ block.settings.title_color }};
  }

  .seren-hero-variant-options-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 10px;
    justify-content: {{ block.settings.text_align_mobile }};
  }

  .seren-hero-variant-option-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: relative;
  }

  .seren-hero-variant-input-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: absolute;
    opacity: 0;
    width: 0;
    height: 0;
  }

  .seren-hero-variant-button-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 10px 20px;
    border: 2px solid #d4c5b9;
    background-color: #ffffff;
    color: {{ block.settings.title_color }};
    border-radius: 8px;
    cursor: pointer;
    font-size: 14px;
    transition: all 0.3s ease;
  }

  .seren-hero-variant-input-{{ ai_gen_id }}:checked + .seren-hero-variant-button-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    background-color: #d4c5b9;
    border-color: #c4b5a9;
    color: #2c2c2c;
  }

  .seren-hero-variant-button-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover {
    border-color: #c4b5a9;
  }

  .seren-hero-error-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    color: #d82c0d;
    font-size: 14px;
    margin-top: 8px;
    display: none;
  }

  .seren-hero-error-{{ ai_gen_id }}.active {
    display: block;
  }

  .seren-hero-button-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    background-color: {{ block.settings.button_bg_color }};
    color: {{ block.settings.button_text_color }};
    border: none;
    padding: {{ block.settings.button_padding }}px 32px;
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.button_border_radius }}px;
    font-size: {{ block.settings.button_font_size }}px;
    font-weight: 600;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: all 0.3s ease;
    width: 100%;
    margin-bottom: {{ block.settings.trust_text_spacing }}px;
  }

  .seren-hero-button-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover {
    opacity: 0.9;
    transform: translateY(-1px);
  }

  .seren-hero-button-{{ ai_gen_id }}:disabled {
    opacity: 0.5;
    cursor: not-allowed;
  }

  .seren-hero-trust-text-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    color: {{ block.settings.trust_text_color }};
    font-size: {{ block.settings.trust_text_font_size }}px;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .seren-hero-trust-boxes-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 16px;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .seren-hero-trust-box-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    font-size: 14px;
    color: {{ block.settings.description_color }};
  }

  .seren-hero-trust-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: 18px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  @media screen and (min-width: 750px) {
    .seren-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      padding-top: {{ block.settings.padding_top_desktop }}px;
      padding-bottom: {{ block.settings.padding_bottom_desktop }}px;
    }

    .seren-hero-layout-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      flex-direction: row;
      align-items: center;
      gap: {{ block.settings.gap_desktop }}px;
    }

    .seren-hero-content-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      flex: 1;
      order: 1;
      text-align: {{ block.settings.text_align_desktop }};
    }

    .seren-hero-image-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      flex: 1;
      order: 2;
    }

    .seren-hero-image-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      height: {{ block.settings.image_height_desktop }}px;
    }

    .seren-hero-image-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      height: {{ block.settings.image_height_desktop }}px;
    }

    .seren-hero-badge-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: {{ block.settings.badge_font_size_desktop }}px;
    }

    .seren-hero-title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: {{ block.settings.title_font_size_desktop }}px;
      margin-left: 0;
      margin-right: 0;
    }

    .seren-hero-description-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: {{ block.settings.description_font_size_desktop }}px;
      margin-left: 0;
      margin-right: 0;
    }

    .seren-hero-variant-options-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      justify-content: {{ block.settings.text_align_desktop }};
    }

    .seren-hero-button-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      width: {% if block.settings.button_full_width_mobile %}100%{% else %}auto{% endif %};
    }

    .seren-hero-trust-boxes-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      justify-content: {{ block.settings.text_align_desktop }};
    }
  }
{% endstyle %}

<seren-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }}
  class="seren-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
  {{ block.shopify_attributes }}
  data-product-id="{{ block.settings.product.id }}"
>
  <div class="seren-hero-container-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
    <div class="seren-hero-layout-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
      <div class="seren-hero-content-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        {% if block.settings.badge_text != blank %}
          <div class="seren-hero-badge-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            {{ block.settings.badge_text }}
          </div>
        {% endif %}

        {% if block.settings.title != blank %}
          <h1 class="seren-hero-title-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            {{ block.settings.title }}
          </h1>
        {% endif %}

        {% if block.settings.description != blank %}
          <div class="seren-hero-description-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            {{ block.settings.description }}
          </div>
        {% endif %}

        {% if block.settings.product != blank and block.settings.show_price %}
          <div class="seren-hero-price-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            {% if block.settings.product.compare_at_price > block.settings.product.price and block.settings.show_compare_price %}
              <span class="price__sale">{{ block.settings.product.price | money }}</span>
              <span class="price__compare">{{ block.settings.product.compare_at_price | money }}</span>
            {% else %}
              <span class="price__regular">{{ block.settings.product.price | money }}</span>
            {% endif %}
          </div>
        {% endif %}

        {% if block.settings.product != blank and block.settings.enable_variant_selector %}
          <div class="seren-hero-variant-selector-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            {% if block.settings.variant_label != blank %}
              <label class="seren-hero-variant-label-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                {{ block.settings.variant_label }}
              </label>
            {% endif %}
            <div class="seren-hero-variant-options-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              {% for variant in block.settings.product.variants %}
                <div class="seren-hero-variant-option-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                  <input
                    type="radio"
                    name="variant-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
                    id="variant-{{ ai_gen_id }}-{{ variant.id }}"
                    value="{{ variant.id }}"
                    class="seren-hero-variant-input-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
                    {% if forloop.first %}checked{% endif %}
                  >
                  <label
                    for="variant-{{ ai_gen_id }}-{{ variant.id }}"
                    class="seren-hero-variant-button-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
                  >
                    {{ variant.title }}
                  </label>
                </div>
              {% endfor %}
            </div>
            <div class="seren-hero-error-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              {{ block.settings.variant_error_text }}
            </div>
          </div>
        {% endif %}

        <button
          type="button"
          class="seren-hero-button-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
          data-add-to-cart
        >
          {{ block.settings.button_text }}
        </button>

        {% if block.settings.trust_text != blank %}
          <div class="seren-hero-trust-text-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            {{ block.settings.trust_text }}
          </div>
        {% endif %}

        <div class="seren-hero-trust-boxes-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          {% if block.settings.trust_box_1_text != blank %}
            <div class="seren-hero-trust-box-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              {% if block.settings.trust_box_1_icon != blank %}
                <span class="seren-hero-trust-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                  {{ block.settings.trust_box_1_icon }}
                </span>
              {% endif %}
              <span>{{ block.settings.trust_box_1_text }}</span>
            </div>
          {% endif %}

          {% if block.settings.trust_box_2_text != blank %}
            <div class="seren-hero-trust-box-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              {% if block.settings.trust_box_2_icon != blank %}
                <span class="seren-hero-trust-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                  {{ block.settings.trust_box_2_icon }}
                </span>
              {% endif %}
              <span>{{ block.settings.trust_box_2_text }}</span>
            </div>
          {% endif %}

          {% if block.settings.trust_box_3_text != blank %}
            <div class="seren-hero-trust-box-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              {% if block.settings.trust_box_3_icon != blank %}
                <span class="seren-hero-trust-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                  {{ block.settings.trust_box_3_icon }}
                </span>
              {% endif %}
              <span>{{ block.settings.trust_box_3_text }}</span>
            </div>
          {% endif %}
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="seren-hero-image-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        {% if block.settings.desktop_image != blank or block.settings.mobile_image != blank %}
          <picture>
            {% if block.settings.mobile_image != blank %}
              <source
                media="(max-width: 749px)"
                srcset="{{ block.settings.mobile_image | image_url: width: 800 }}"
              >
            {% endif %}
            {% if block.settings.desktop_image != blank %}
              <img
                src="{{ block.settings.desktop_image | image_url: width: 1200 }}"
                alt="{{ block.settings.image_alt_text | escape }}"
                class="seren-hero-image-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
                loading="lazy"
                width="{{ block.settings.desktop_image.width }}"
                height="{{ block.settings.desktop_image.height }}"
              >
            {% elsif block.settings.mobile_image != blank %}
              <img
                src="{{ block.settings.mobile_image | image_url: width: 800 }}"
                alt="{{ block.settings.image_alt_text | escape }}"
                class="seren-hero-image-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
                loading="lazy"
                width="{{ block.settings.mobile_image.width }}"
                height="{{ block.settings.mobile_image.height }}"
              >
            {% endif %}
          </picture>
        {% else %}
          <div class="seren-hero-image-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            {{ 'hero-apparel-1' | placeholder_svg_tag }}
          </div>
        {% endif %}
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</seren-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }}>

<script>
  (function() {
    class SerenHero{{ ai_gen_id }} extends HTMLElement {
      constructor() {
        super();
        this.button = this.querySelector('[data-add-to-cart]');
        this.variantInputs = this.querySelectorAll('.seren-hero-variant-input-{{ ai_gen_id }}');
        this.errorMessage = this.querySelector('.seren-hero-error-{{ ai_gen_id }}');
        this.productId = this.dataset.productId;
      }

      connectedCallback() {
        if (this.button) {
          this.button.addEventListener('click', this.handleAddToCart.bind(this));
        }
      }

      getSelectedVariantId() {
        const selectedInput = this.querySelector('.seren-hero-variant-input-{{ ai_gen_id }}:checked');
        return selectedInput ? selectedInput.value : null;
      }

      handleAddToCart() {
        const variantId = this.getSelectedVariantId();

        if (!variantId) {
          if (this.errorMessage) {
            this.errorMessage.classList.add('active');
          }
          return;
        }

        if (this.errorMessage) {
          this.errorMessage.classList.remove('active');
        }

        this.button.disabled = true;
        this.button.textContent = 'Wird hinzugefügt...';

        fetch('/cart/add.js', {
          method: 'POST',
          headers: {
            'Content-Type': 'application/json',
          },
          body: JSON.stringify({
            id: variantId,
            quantity: 1
          })
        })
        .then(response => response.json())
        .then(data => {
          this.button.textContent = '✓ Hinzugefügt';
          
          window.dispatchEvent(new CustomEvent('cart:refresh'));
          
          if (window.theme && window.theme.cart) {
            window.theme.cart.refresh();
          }

          setTimeout(() => {
            this.button.disabled = false;
            this.button.textContent = '{{ block.settings.button_text }}';
          }, 2000);
        })
        .catch(error => {
          console.error('Error:', error);
          this.button.disabled = false;
          this.button.textContent = '{{ block.settings.button_text }}';
          alert('Es gab ein Problem beim Hinzufügen zum Warenkorb. Bitte versuchen Sie es erneut.');
        });
      }
    }

    customElements.define('seren-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }}', SerenHero{{ ai_gen_id }});
  })();
</script>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "SEREN Hero",
  "tag": null,
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Produkt & Warenkorb"
    },
    {
      "type": "product",
      "id": "product",
      "label": "Produkt auswählen"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "button_text",
      "label": "Button Text",
      "default": "In den Warenkorb"
    },
    {
      "type": "checkbox",
      "id": "enable_variant_selector",
      "label": "Farbauswahl aktivieren",
      "default": true
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "variant_label",
      "label": "Label für Farbauswahl",
      "default": "Farbe wählen"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "variant_error_text",
      "label": "Fehlertext",
      "default": "Bitte wählen Sie eine Farbe aus"
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Hero Bild"
    },
    {
      "type": "image_picker",
      "id": "desktop_image",
      "label": "Desktop Bild"
    },
    {
      "type": "image_picker",
      "id": "mobile_image",
      "label": "Mobile Bild"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "image_alt_text",
      "label": "Bild Alt Text",
      "default": "SEREN Soft-Heat Touch-Up Styling Comb"
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "image_border_radius",
      "min": 0,
      "max": 40,
      "step": 2,
      "unit": "px",
      "label": "Bild Border Radius",
      "default": 20
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
